# Sub-Second (<1s) Backend Performance Optimization Plan

Optimize the existing Enterprise AI SQL Agent backend architecture to achieve **sub-second (<1s)** natural language to SQL generation and execution times while maintaining 100% local offline execution and strict 8-table database scope.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Performance Target**: Achieve NL-to-SQL generation under 1 second by combining in-memory LRU schema caching, query pattern date substitution, compressed prompts (<500 tokens), tuned local LLM generation parameters (`temperature=0`, `max_tokens=200`, `stop=[';']`), and SQLAlchemy connection pooling.

> [!NOTE]
> **Preserve Existing Structure**: All 8 allowed tables (`users`, `wallet_transaction`, `sku_inventories`, `companies`, `machine_details`, `withdrawal_request`, `automatic_transactions`, `automate`) and existing module layout (`agent`, `retriever`, `embedding`, `prompt`, `validator`, `database`, `api`, `utils`, `static`) remain intact.

